    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Master Sophisticated Battle Maneuvers</p></blockquote><p>Battle Masters are students of the art of battle, learning martial techniques passed down through generations. The most accomplished are well-rounded figures who combine carefully honed combat skills with academic study of history, theory, and the arts.</p><h3>Battle Master Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.NAMkw4rRNMT46vWa]{Combat Superiority}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.wZFfLDI4l4zZFARn]{Student of War}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.do1EnRbgJMccGWfS]{Know Your Enemy}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.pLH1nZXcIAnxGswy]{Improved Combat Superiority}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.LEC0tHBp8clVdeeu]{Relentless}</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.j1PXnjHDxwutrBzW]{Ultimate Combat Superiority}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
